        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okwezibwa kwa Arooni n'abatabani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA akagambira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Otwale Arooni n'abatabani otwale ebyokujwara, amagita agokweza abantu n'ebintu, enimi enyakuheebwayo okuganyiza ebibi, entaama empaya ibiri n'ekigega ky'emigaati etatumbisiibwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekitebe kyona eky'abantu, okisorooleze ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yakora nkooku MUKAMA yamuragiire, ekitebe ky'abantu kyasorrokanira ha rwigi orw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagambira ekitebe ky'abantu ati: “Kinu nikyo kintu MUKAMA eki aragiire kukorwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaleeta Arooni n'abatabani, yaboogya n'amaizi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni yamujweka ekooti, yamuteega omweko, yamujweka ekanzu, yamugerekaho ekitaahiro, yamuteega omutanda gwa kitaani ogunyakukozirwe kurungi muno yagugumya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamutaho ekya ha kifuba ekinyakurumu amabaale abiri Ulimu na Tumimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamuta ekihuuta ha mutwe, yamutaho ekondo eya zaabbu, niyo ekondo ey'obuhikiriire, MUKAMA nkooku yaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yakwata amagita aganyakweza abantu n'ebintu eby'okwezibwa yagaseesa ha Nju ya Ruhanga na ha bintu byona ebikaba birumu yabyeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agandi yagamiisa ha itambiro emirundi musanju, yalyeza na byona ebikoraho, ebbeseni n'ekintu h'eyemerezibwa, nabyo yabyeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagita agandi yagaseesa ha mutwe gwa Arooni yamweza amusoroole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaleeta batabani ba Arooni, yabajweka ekooti, yabateega emyeko, ha mutwe yababoheraho enkofiira nkooku MUKAMA yamuragiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yaleesire enimi ey'ekihongwa eky'okuganyiza ekibi; Arooni n'abatabani baata emikono yabo ha mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagiita, yatwara esagama, yagisiiga n'orukumo rwe okwehinguliriza amahembe g'itambiro, yalyeza, endi yagiseesa ha kicweka ekya hansi eky'itambiro, yalisoroora yalisabira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yakwata ebisajwa byona ebikaba biri ha byenda by'enimi, n'obune obw'empagara, ensigo zombi n'ebisajwa byazo, yabyokeza ha itambiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu orususu rw'enimi, enyama yayo n'efa yayo, akabyokya n'omurro aheeru y'orukande, nkooku MUKAMA yaragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo yaleeta entaama empaya ey'ekihongwa eky'okwokya, Arooni n'abatabani baata emikono yabo ha mutwe gwayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagiita, esagama yagimiisira itambiro kulyehinguliriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaama obu yamazire kwihwa emyanya, Musa yayokya omutwe, emyanya n'ebisajwa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi ebyenda n'ebirenge obu byamazire kwogebwa n'amaizi, entaama yoona empaya, Musa yagyokeza ha itambiro, ebe kihongwa ekyokiibwe omurro ekirukuboyera kurungi MUKAMA, nkoku yaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yaleeta entaama empaya endi, niyo entaama ey'okutaahya abakozi omu mulimo ogw'okuheereza; Arooni n'abatabani baata emikono yabo ha mutwe gwayo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yagiita, yaihaho esagama, yagita ha nsonga ey'okutu okw'obulyo okwa Arooni, ha kyara ekisaija eky'omukono ogw'obulyo na ha kyara ekisaija eky'ekigere eky'obulyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baaleeta batabani ba Arooni, Musa yata esagama ha nsonga z'amatu gaabo ag'obulyo, ha byara ebisaija eby'emikono yabo ey'obulyo, na ha byara ebisaija eby'ebigere byaabu eby'obulyo, esagama endi, Musa yagimiisira itambiro okulyehinguliriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yakwata ebisajwa, ekitere n'ebisajwa ebikaba biri ha byenda, obune obw'empagara, ensigo zombi n'ebisajwa byazo, n'ekirumbu eky'obulyo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omu kigega ekikaba kirumu emigaati etatumbisiibwe, ekikaba kimuli omumaiso, yaihamu keeki emu etatumbisiibwe n'akaasi k'omugaati akanyakusiigirwe, amagita na bisikwiti emu, yabita ha bisajwa na ha kirumbu eky'obulyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "binu byona yabikwasa Arooni n'abatabani, baabiimukyaimukya, bibe kihongwa ekiimukaimukiibwe omumaiso ga MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma, Musa yabiiha omu mikono yabo, yabyokeza ha itambiro hamu n'ekihongwa ekyokeze, kibe kihongwa ekyokeziibwe habwa MUKAMA, ekirukuboya kurungi, eky'okusoroora abantu ab'okukora omulimo ogw'obuheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yakwata ekifuba ky'entaama empaya, yakiimukyaimukya, kibe kihongwa ekiimukaimukiibwe omumaiso ga MUKAMA, ogu gukaba mugabo gwa Musa ogwarugire ha ntaama ey'okusoroora abaheereza MUKAMA nkooku yamuragiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Musa yakwasire amagita aganyakweza abantu n'ebintu eby'okwezibwa, n'ekicweka eky'esagama eyekaba eri ha itambiro, yagimiisira Arooni n'ebyokujwara bye kandi yagimiisira batabani be n'ebyokujwara byabo, yataahya Arooni n'ebyokujwara bye, batabani ba Arooni n'ebyokujwara byabo omu mulimo ogw'okuheereza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Musa yagambira Arooni n'abatabani ati: “Enyama mugicumbire ha mulyango ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu, nuho mugiriire hamu n'emigaati enyakuli omu kigega eky'ekihongwa eky'okusoroora abaheereza, nkooku naragiire ningamba nti: ‘Arooni n'abatabani nubo baligirya.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyama n'amagita ebinyakusigaireho, mubyokye bisiiriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutalituruka omu Heema ey'okutangatanganiramu okumara akasumi ak'ebiro musanju eby'okusoroorwa kwanyu obu kalikahwaho, habwokuba kubasoroora kulitwara akasumi k'ebiro musanju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyakorwa hati, MUKAMA nuwe aragiire kikorwe kubeesengerereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimwija kwikara ha mulimo ogw'Eheema ey'okutangatanganiramu omu bwire obwa nyamusana n'obw'ekiro kumara ebiro musanju, nimukora MUKAMA ebi aragiire, mutaikara kufa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arooni n'abatabani bakakora ebintu byona MUKAMA ebi yakaragiire Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.8.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
